    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at a 2022 f-150 with a slipping issue. my scan tool is showing some really irregular pressure spikes in the hydraulic circuit when it's under load. any idea what the most likely culprits for those kinds of pressure fluctuations would be?",
