    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok, solenoids make sense. i checked the wiring and it looks solid. if it isnt the solenoids or the sensor, could it be something physically inside the valve body or even contamination in the fluid causing these spikes? i'm trying to figure out if i need to pull the pan and take a look.",
